 OkOrCancelAutoPress;globalGuiParms;parms
⍝ Presents a "Yes" and a "No" button together with a message
 globalGuiParms←##.GUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 globalGuiParms.regKey←'MyApp\Kai1'
 globalGuiParms.icon←⎕NEW'Icon'(⊂'File'(GetFile'Sample.ico'))
 parms←##.GUI.Dialogs.CreateParmsForOkOrCancel
 parms.timeout←4
 parms.autoPress←0
 parms.statusbarMessage←'This message is shown in the status bar, and it will define the width of the dialog box'
 ⎕←parms globalGuiParms ##.GUI.Dialogs.OkOrCancel'Proceed actions (this may take a long time)'
